Each quarter has 13 weeks.

Examples:

0  // 13 = 0   (weeks 1–13)
12 // 13 = 0
13 // 13 = 1   (weeks 14–26)


So:

Weeks 1–13 → group 0

Weeks 14–26 → group 1

